{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Zjawa</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fear not Brother, tonight we are without sin. In Crusade all is forgiven.&quot;<br>It is 13th century, and seeds of heresy sprout in the west. <br>By the grace of Pope, all who take up arms against this evil shall have eternal salvation.<br>Or so you were told. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zjawa: Bloodstained Soul is a Survival Horror RPG with a unique\u00a0Timed-Turn Combat System, traverse eerie woods, grim churches and desolate town, gather items and kill or avoid macabre creatures standing in your way, your holy mission. Death is inevitable, but each is but a step towards final victory. For better or for worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras/9022fc67984f2231bc9d79412f5e7f72.avif?t=1761821339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644010/extras_big/9022fc67984f2231bc9d79412f5e7f72.avif?t=1761821339 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark and opressive atmosphere,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Timed-Turn Combat System - Make all your moves in time, or lose your chance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multi-stage boss battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Macabre monster design,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Resource Management,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seamless world - Entering buildings does not transfer you to different location,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple endings,</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644010?t=1761821339","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644010?t=1761821339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass